      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The poshengu can touch a creature and spend 1 minute focusing to see the path it has traveled, up to a decade into its past. This information only includes the geographical course and the time spent in each location. It doesn't include any information about what the creature said or did along that path. Once the poshengu has traced a creature's path, it has Advantage on History and Insight checks related to that creature until the poshengu finishes a Long Rest or traces the path of a different creature.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
